WEBVTT

00:12:28.619 --> 00:12:30.996
My mother is even more conservative.

00:12:30.996 --> 00:12:33.874
(Laughter)

00:12:34.458 --> 00:12:37.252
When I came out as transgender,
they rejected me.

00:12:37.795 --> 00:12:39.880
I thought I would never
speak to them again.

00:12:41.006 --> 00:12:44.259
Last January, I took a chance
and called my dad on his birthday,

00:12:44.301 --> 00:12:45.511
and he took my call.

00:12:46.094 --> 00:12:47.638
We talked for about a half hour,

00:12:47.638 --> 00:12:50.432
and about a month later I asked
if I could come for a visit

00:12:50.432 --> 00:12:51.850
and they said yes.

00:12:52.267 --> 00:12:56.772
And last spring, I had a delightfully
redemptive three-hour visit with them.

00:12:56.814 --> 00:12:58.899
I've met with them twice since.

00:12:59.358 --> 00:13:02.694
But that day, toward the end
of the conversation that first day,